sequenceDiagram
    participant InfServers as vLLM / EPP<br/>Inference Servers
    participant Prom as Prometheus /<br/>Thanos Querier<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant KEDA as KEDA<br/>ScaledObject Triggers
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant HPA as HPA<br/>(scale subresource)
    participant Workload as Deployment /<br/>LeaderWorkerSet

    Note over InfServers,Workload: Flow 1: KEDA Autoscaling (Production Path)
    InfServers->>Prom: Expose metrics (queue depth,<br/>KV-cache, vLLM signals)<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, SA token
    KEDA->>Prom: Query Prometheus triggers<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.2+, Bearer token
    Prom-->>KEDA: Metric values
    KEDA->>K8sAPI: Update HPA via scale subresource<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, SA token
    K8sAPI->>HPA: Scale target
    HPA->>K8sAPI: Patch Deployment/LWS replicas<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, SA token
    K8sAPI->>Workload: Scale replicas

    Note over InfServers,Workload: Flow 2: WVA Controller (Legacy, Deprecated)
    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        participant WVA as WVA Controller<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
        WVA->>Prom: Query inference metrics<br/>HTTPS, TLS 1.2+, Bearer/mTLS
        Prom-->>WVA: Metric values (Kalman filtered)
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Watch InferencePool, HPA, ConfigMap<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, SA token
        K8sAPI-->>WVA: Resource events
        WVA->>K8sAPI: Update scale subresource<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, SA token
        K8sAPI->>Workload: Scale replicas
        Prom->>WVA: Scrape /metrics<br/>HTTPS 8443/TCP<br/>TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    end

    Note over InfServers,Workload: Flow 3: Benchmark Evaluation
    participant Bench as llm-d-benchmark<br/>Harness
    Bench->>K8sAPI: Stand up scenario<br/>HTTPS 6443/TCP, kubeconfig
    Bench->>InfServers: Drive load generation<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    InfServers-->>Bench: Responses
    Bench->>Prom: Collect autoscaling metrics<br/>HTTPS, Bearer token
    Prom-->>Bench: Scaling behavior data
